<PageTitle>Data Table — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Data Table</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    shadcn's own page here is a guide rather than a component — TanStack Table wired to <code>&lt;Table&gt;</code>. On static SSR there is no client-side table state to manage: sorting, filtering and paging are query parameters, the URL is the state, and the server answers. The <a href="/blocks">data table block</a> is the worked example.
</p>


